					{
						"description": "# Analyst Response Process\nIf the threat intelligence lookup does not find the URL or domain to be\nsuspicious (or malicious), then the analyst should perform the following:\n1. Review the incident information.\n2. Navigate to the sandbox machine using RDP and open a browser.\n3. Manually open the link in the sandbox machine to determine if it is\nmalicious.\n4. Select remediate to block the URL and reset the user's password if\nnecessary.\nFor more information, visit the internal [wiki](https://paloaltonetworks.com).",
